  "goodToKnow": "Der Gastwirt (die Gastwirtin) is an innkeeper or pub landlord, running a Gastwirtschaft, Gasthaus or Kneipe; short form der Wirt. Rural Gasthäuser, once the centre of village life, are closing in many regions because of staff shortages and few successors, a trend called Wirtshaussterben. Die Gastronomie is the hospitality industry. Plural: die Gastwirte."
